<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.AFRICAN TRADE DATA MAY BE RELEASED ON FRIDAY.</title>
<headline>S.AFRICAN TRADE DATA MAY BE RELEASED ON FRIDAY.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African June trade data would not be released on Wednesday or Thursday, but could be released on Friday, a Customs and Excise official said.</p>
<p>A Reuters consensus poll of economists forecast the June trade balance would show a surplus of 1.28 billion rand compared with May's 1.75 billion rand surplus.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
